Build and test on x86-64 Linux with GCC, make, and ncurses development files.
All required source files, headers, assembly, and the supplied snake library
are in this folder. Makefile_FALL2026 is the original reference template;
use Makefile for the build adapted to the supplied library files.

Run from this folder:

    make all
    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=.
    export LD_LIBRARY_PATH
    ./nums
    ./snakes
    ./hungry

The demos link against your static liblwp.a. LD_LIBRARY_PATH lets the snake
demos locate the supplied libsnakes.so. Use an interactive terminal for snakes.

To rebuild everything:

    make allclean
    make all

To package this folder's build inputs:

    make submission

This creates project2_submission.tar.gz containing the sources, headers,
assembly, Makefile, README, and supplied snake library needed to rebuild.
